        <mxCell id="111" value="• Base hidden dimension = 128.  • KeepT24 preserves the encoded temporal length at 24 instead of reducing it to 12.  • CAPT is shown compactly in this overview; Fig. B expands its internal logic.&#xa;• Final pipeline: Skeleton clip → Base Skeleton Encoder → Part Pyramid → ConfAware → PDTM → Global Pooling → FC classifier.  • The final run uses confidence-aware pyramid aggregation, KeepT24, and residual dilated temporal convolution." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=17;fontColor=#1f2937;fontStyle=0;" parent="2" vertex="1">
